    "Description": "Cockpit component for managing libvirt virtual machines.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* cockpit-machines: cockpit-appstream: RHSM access-token disclosure through image helper command-line arguments (CVE-2026-113495)\n\n* cockpit-machines: cockpit-appstream: VNC console password disclosure through virt-xml command-line arguments (CVE-2026-113496)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
